        <item>
            <title>3.25.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:26:06 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>227</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.25.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- **Coordinator sessions.** A new Normal / Coordinator chip in the launcher starts a session in Claude Code's coordinator mode: Claude hands every task to parallel workers and reports back on its own as each one finishes, much like Projects in the Claude desktop app. The choice applies to that launch only, works for this Mac and for another Mac running this version, and a resumed session keeps the mode it started in. Coordinator sessions also work with a new worktree.
- `canopyctl open --coordinator` (and `coordinator: true` on the control API's `open_session`) starts a coordinator session from a script or skill.
]]></description>
